      en: ["Officially designated as a classified forest in 1937.", "The Thiès plateau reaches an elevation of approximately 130 meters.", "Important site for the collection of non-timber forest products.", "Home to a high density of majestic baobab trees.", "Acts as a natural windbreak for the growing city of Thiès.", "The geological base consists of phosphate-rich lateritic rock."],
