      en: ["Total length of the river: 1,120 kilometers.", "Navigability: 480 kilometers from the Atlantic mouth.", "Source: Fouta Djallon highlands in Guinea.", "Mouth: Atlantic Ocean at the city of Banjul.", "Drainage basin: Roughly 77,000 square kilometers.", "Wildlife: Home to more than 600 species of birds."],
